      "type": "/type/text",
      "value": "This is a book about a handful of men with a curious claim to fame."
    },
    "description": "\"The Worldly Philosophers is a bestselling classic that not only enables us to see more deeply into our history but helps us better understand our own times. In this seventh edition, Robert L. Heilbroner provides a view theme that connects thinkers as diverse as Adam Smith and Karl Marx. The theme is the common focus of their highly varied ideas - namely, the search to understand how a capitalist society works.\"--BOOK JACKET.",
